es Patterson | Lisa Papademetriou\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780316207621\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 250\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 30 x 220\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594342797465,"sku":"9RF9780316207621","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/homeroom-diaries-331283.jpg?v=1752150897"},{"product_id":"the-sheikh-and-the-dustbin-and-other-mcauslan-stories","title":"The Sheikh and the Dustbin and Other McAuslan Stories","description":"\u003cp\u003eThese stories continue the career of Private McAuslan, described by his platoon commander as \"the biggest walking disaster to hit the British Army since Ancient Pistol\", as he goes across North Africa and Scotland. George MacDonald Fraser is the author of the \"Flashman\" novels.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: George MacDonald Fraser\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780002227070\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 0 x 0\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594348564633,"sku":"9RG9780002227070","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-sheikh-and-the-dustbin-and-other-mcauslan-stories-727773.jpg?v=1752150896"},{"product_id":"everything-everything","title":"Everything, everything","description":"\u003cp\u003eYou've seen the amazing trailer for Everything, Everything starring Amandla Stenberg and Nick Robinson . . . Now read the incredible #1 New York Times bestselling story before you see the movie, in cinemas soon. 'Can't wait to see this! Absolutely loved the book' - Zoella Maddy is allergic to the world; stepping outside the sterile sanctuary of her home could kill her. But then Olly moves in next door. And just like that, Maddy realizes there's more to life than just being alive. You only get one chance at first love. And Maddy is ready to risk everything, everything to see where it leads. 'Powerful, lovely, heart-wrenching, and so absorbing I devoured it in one sitting' - Jennifer Niven, author of All the Bright Places And don't miss Nicola Yoon's #1 New York Times bestseller The Sun Is Also a Star, in which two teens are brought together just when the universe is sending them in opposite directions. \u003cbr\u003eDimensions:129 x 200 \u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Nicola Yoon \u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9780552574235 \u003cbr\u003eFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003ePages 304\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594747908249,"sku":"12RC9780552574235","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/8e2e3d4a0ea6da154d2cdc1861800a5b.jpg?v=1698145258"},{"product_id":"let-it-snow","title":"Let It Snow","description":"\u003cp\u003eThree wonderful holiday romances by three of America's bestselling authors, including John Green - author of the multi-million bestseller The Fault in Our Stars.  An ill-timed storm on Christmas Eve buries the residents of Gracetown under multiple feet of snow and causes quite a bit of chaos. One brave soul ventures out into the storm from her stranded train and sets off a chain of events that will change quite a few lives. Over the next three days one girl takes a risky shortcut with an adorable stranger, three friends set out to win a race to the Waffle House (and the hash brown spoils), and the fate of a teacup pig falls into the hands of a lovesick barista.  A trio of today's bestselling authors - John Green, Maureen Johnson, and Lauren Myracle - brings all the magic of holidays to life in three hilarious and charming interconnected tales of love, romance, and kisses that will steal your breath away.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: John Green | Maureen Johnson | Lauren Myracle\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141349176\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 354\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42594751381657,"sku":"11RB9780141349176","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/let-it-snow-599951.jpg?v=1752150895"},{"product_id":"the-subtle-knife-adult-edition-his-dark-materials","title":"The Subtle Knife: Adult Edition (His Dark Materials)","description":"\u003cp\u003eLyra finds herself in a shimmering, haunted underworld-Cittagazze, where soul-eating Specters stalk the streets and wingbeats of distant angels sound against the sky. But she is not without allies: 12-year-old Will Parry, fleeing for his life after taking another's, has also stumbled into this strange new realm. On a perilous journey from world to world, Lyra and Will discover an object of devastating power. And with every step, they move closer to an even greater threat-and the shattering truth of their own destiny.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Philip Pullman\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780439994132\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Trade Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 122 x 196\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595489710233,"sku":"10RD9780439994132","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-subtle-knife-adult-edition-his-dark-materials-796964.jpg?v=1694792469"},{"product_id":"times-of-contempt","title":"Times Of Contempt","description":"\u003cp\u003eCiri is the child of prophesy, foretold to have the power to change the world, for good or for evil. And she's finally on her way to the magical college on Thanedd Island to learn how to master her powers.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eAccompanied by the powerful anchantress Yennefer, the journey should be a simple one, but they are being followed and shortly afterward Ciri is mistaken for a student and arrested. Seperated from Yennefer and thrown on her own resources, Ciri turns to Geraly, a powerful Witcher, for aid ... and takes the first steps along a path which will lead to revolution ...\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Andrzej Sapkowski\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780575090941\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Trade Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 331\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 127 x 198\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595542532249,"sku":"10RF9780575090941","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/times-of-contempt-205937.jpg?v=1694792691"},{"product_id":"artemis-fowl-book-4-artemis-fowl-and-the-opal-deception","title":"Artemis Fowl (Book 4): Artemis Fowl And The Opal Deception","description":"\u003cp\u003eEvil pixie, Opal Koboi, is back and she's more dangerous than ever. This time she doesn't just want power over the fairy People - this time she wants the humans too. Captain Holly Short is the only fairy with a hope of stopping her, but as Holly knows, it takes one genius criminal mastermind to fight another. But the 14-year-old genius that Holly is thinking of doesn't even remember that fairies exist. How is she going to convince Artemis Fowl to help her stop Opal? Gold usually does the trick, and this time is should be no different. Or is Artemis changing?\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Eoin Colfer\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141315492\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 368\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 128 x 196\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595574218905,"sku":"16RA-3-9780141315492","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/artemis-fowl-book-4-artemis-fowl-and-the-opal-deception-852029.jpg?v=1752150894"},{"product_id":"call-of-archaon-the-realmgate-wars-4","title":"Call of Archaon (The Realmgate Wars #4)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThree champions of Chaos are roused from the ongoing war against Sigmar's servants and compelled to journey into the heart of darkness. Their goal? To serve at the side of the Everchosen himself, Archaon, as one of his Varanguard. But the trials before them are many, and not all will survive...\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eOf the many champions of Chaos, none are as great or as feared as mighty Archaon. He is the Everchosen, Exalted Grand Marshal of the Apocalypse and Ender of Worlds, and it is a worthy warrior indeed who can fight by his side. Such Knights of Ruin are known as the Varanguard. Only by answering the call of Archaon can a warrior of Chaos ascend to their ranks, and acceptance is never guaranteed, for their mettle must first be proven. In this dark tale, three fell champions of the Chaos Gods all heed the call of the Everchosen. Each desires the ultimate prize: to become part of the Varanguard. But where one is chosen, others will fail, for Archaon’s will is cruel and his trials exacting...\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eIt's the whole epic Call of Archaon saga in one book. See what trials the followers of Chaos must undergo to prove themselves worthy of the ultimate honour: joining the ranks of the Everchosen's Varanguard. It's brutal, bloody and with three (anti)heroes, there's no way they're all succeeding... or surviving.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe contents of this novel have been previously released in the form of the short stories Beneath the Black Thumb, Eye of the Storm, The Solace of Rage, Knight of Corruption, The Trial of the Chosen, In the Lands of the Blind, Blood and Plague, and See No Evil.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: David Annandale | Guy Haley | Rob Sanders | David Guymer\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781784960780\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 304\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 0 x 0\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595574841497,"sku":"11RA9781784960780","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/call-of-archaon-the-realmgate-wars-4-287988.jpg?v=1752150893"},{"product_id":"diary-of-a-wimpy-kid-09-the-long-haul","title":"Diary of a Wimpy Kid 09. The Long Haul","description":"\u003cp\u003eA family road trip is supposed to be a lot of fun . . . unless, of course, you’re the Heffleys. The journey starts off full of promise, then quickly takes several wrong turns. Gas station bathrooms, crazed seagulls, a fender bender, and a runaway pig—not exactly Greg Heffley’s idea of a good time. But even the worst road trip can turn into an adventure—and this is one the Heffleys won’t soon forget.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jeff Kinney\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781419717604\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 20 x 141\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595575169177,"sku":"9RC9781419717604","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/diary-of-a-wimpy-kid-09-the-long-haul-135659.jpg?v=1694790252"},{"product_id":"necropolis-city-of-the-dead","title":"Necropolis: City of the Dead","description":"\u003cp\u003eTo stop the evil corporation Nightrise from unleashing its devastating power around the globe, fifteen-year-old Matt and three other Gatekeepers travel to Hong Kong to find Scarlet, the final Gatekeeper, whose fate is inextricably joined to their own.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Anthony Horowitz\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781406318531\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 387\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 136 x 212\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595579527321,"sku":"17RB-4-9781406318531","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/necropolis-city-of-the-dead-186460.jpg?v=1694791100"},{"product_id":"running-wild","title":"Running Wild","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe epic and heart-rending jungle adventure from the nation's favourite storyteller Michael Morpurgo. For Will and his mother, going to Indonesia isn't just a holiday. It's an escape, a new start, a chance to put things behind them - things like the death of Will's father. And to begin with, it seems to be just what they both needed. But then Oona, the elephant Will is riding on the beach, begins acting strangely, shying away from the sea. And that's when the tsunami comes crashing in, and Oona begins to run. Except that when the tsunami is gone, Oona just keeps on running. With nothing on his back but a shirt and nothing to sustain him but a bottle of water, Will must learn to survive deep in the jungle. Luckily, though, he's not completely alone... He's got Oona.\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Michael Morpurgo\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780007267026\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 196\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 133 x 203\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595581034649,"sku":"11RC9780007267026","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/running-wild-684692.jpg?v=1694791333"},{"product_id":"the-ugly-truth","title":"The ugly truth","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe massively funny fifth book in the bestselling and award-winning Diary of a Wimpy Kid series - now in paperback. Greg Heffley has always been in a hurry to grow up. But is getting older really all it's cracked up to be? Suddenly Greg is dealing with the pressures of boy-girl parties, increased responsibilities, and even the awkward changes that come with getting older. And after a fight with his best friend Rowley, it looks like Greg is going to have to face the \"ugly truth\" all by himself . . .\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jeff Kinney\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141340821\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 240\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595583197337,"sku":"3RC9780141340821","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/the-ugly-truth-229092.jpg?v=1752150888"},{"product_id":"tom-gates-family-friends-and-furry-creatures","title":"Tom Gates: Family, Friends And Furry Creatures","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn the next hilarious illustrated instalment of Tom Gates, Mr Fullerman has a class assignment: a family tree! Tom's ready to learn all about the Gates family, his friends and a furry creature (or two!)\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Liz Pichon\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781407168111\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 241\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 24 x 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42595584016537,"sku":"13RE9781407168111","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/tom-gates-family-friends-and-furry-creatures-133575.jpg?v=1694792791"},{"product_id":"dogs","title":"Dogs","description":"\u003cp\u003eGorgeous canines of every shape, size and colour are bounding through this irresistible book of opposites. Can you choose one dog to love best of all?  With playful pencil and watercolour illustrations to delight children and adults alike, everyone will long to bark along with the Chihuahua and tickle the Dalmatian's tummy. Emily Gravett has created another wonderfully satisfying book - with a twist in the tail. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:250 x 250  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Emily Gravett \